OL,14,     Fplumber Jake to resus, where it's
OL,15,     Fsuspected that he has badly broken
OL,16,     Fhis ankle. And Alistair needs
OL,17,     Fassessing after he's injured in a
OL,18,     Fgas explosion at work.
